docs {
  ## API explanation
  One active teacher -- the profile page at `/online-classes/teachers/[name]`.
  An inactive teacher returns 404.

  Same shape as an entry in the **teachers** list: bio, specialisation tags, the
  weekly availability rules and the "Accepting new students" / "Limited
  availability" badge. Calendar ids and Meet links are never exposed publicly.

  For the profile page's "Book with [Name]" CTA, pair this with
  `GET /public/teachers/<id>/packages/`, which adds the bookable packages and the
  next free slot.

  ## API example response
  {
    "id": "1e54776b-9910-4742-9f8c-8efd23912d4a",
    "name": "Fernando Cordero",
    "profile_img_url": "",
    "tags": ["beginners", "conversation", "travel spanish"],
    "institute": "Universidad Central del Ecuador",
    "availability": [
      { "day": "mon", "start": "08:00", "end": "16:00" },
      { "day": "tue", "start": "08:00", "end": "16:00" }
    ],
    "accepting_students": true,
    "availability_label": "Accepting new students",
    "description": "I have taught Spanish for twelve years and still love the moment a student stops translating in their head.",
    "lang": "en"
  }
}
